The nine victims of the crash were:
- Juan Gallo, 45-year-old;
- Ítalo Gallo, circa 25, related to the first, both of Italian origins;
- Rubén Carrillo, 16, from Córdoba;
- Claudio Enrique Rivas, 25;
- Elvio Ulises Etchegaray, 29, whose given name was reported to be Pedro Ulises by different sources...
